4b:["$","p","104",{"className":"text-[#839BBE] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["No single provider is objectively best for every use case. But if I had to pick one for general-purpose cloud hosting in 2026, Google Cloud edges ahead with the best combination of price, performance, and user experience — while AWS remains the safe, battle-tested choice for complex enterprise deployments."]}]
